{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45696","headline":"别杜将军 · 贯休","name":"别杜将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊余本是胡爲者，采蕈锄茶在穷野。\n偶披蓑笠事空王，余力爲文拟何谢。\n少年心在青云端，知音满地皆龙鸾。\n遽逢天步艰难日，深藏溪谷空长叹。\n偶出重围遇英哲，留我江楼经岁月。\n身隈玉帐香满衣，梦历金盆雨和雪。\n东风来兮歌式微，深云道人召来归。\n燕辞大厦兮将何爲，蒙蒙花雨兮莺飞飞，一汀杨柳同依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}